<title>USA: Covenant Bancorp sets 4 percent stock div.</title>
<headline>Covenant Bancorp sets 4 percent stock div.</headline>
<dateline>HADDONFIELD, N.J. 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Covenant Bancorp Inc said that it has declared a four percent dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be issued on July 14, 1997 to shareholders of record on June 24, 1997.</p>
<p>The total number of shares outstanding was not immediately available.</p>
